set.body:
Implement operator-estimation policies as an upstream certified stage, separate from parameter penalties.

Families:
- fixed and selected linear covariance/scatter shrinkage;
- PSD repair with explicit tolerance and evidence downgrade/upgrade;
- support restriction and gauge fixing;
- LDA within-scatter policies;
- joint block CCA/multiset shrinkage preserving block adjoints, shared scale/gauge, and joint PSD whenever proven.

Every policy records target, strength, scale matching, fixed versus estimated selection, joint versus blockwise application, preservation claims, failures, and provenance.

Acceptance:
- joint-block PSD and adjoint laws;
- comparison to independent covariance-shrinkage references;
- blockwise unsafe alternatives visibly downgrade evidence;
- policies cannot be confused with ridge terms in the program IR;
- fold selection hook is present but data-driven fitting is completed in the ModelSpec child.
